# ============================================
# Wealth AI Pro — Environment Variables
# ============================================

# ---- ACCURACY-PLAN PHASE 1 (2026-09-23): the three proven-safe flags
# now ship ON in this template. v21.12: AI_ACCURACY_SUITE (upar dekho)
# ab in teeno ka master hai — uske ON hone par per-flag `false` ignored. ----

# ---- V2 SIGNAL-ACCURACY UPGRADE (11 → 14 models) ----
# ---- v21.12 MASTER ACCURACY SUITE SWITCH ----
# Ek switch — poora Superintelligence accuracy suite (16 voting seats
# + 4 mesh shadow + tape-MTF w1.6 + 3× learning window + META ensemble).
# DEFAULT ON (khaali/unset = ON). Iske ON hone par neeche wale teeno
# LEGACY per-flag values (AI_ENABLE_V2_MODELS / AI_ENABLE_MESH_MODELS /
# AI_ENABLE_MTF_CONFLUENCE) IGNORED hote hain — chahe .env me false pade
# ho. Ye v21.12 ka fix hai: purane .env ki stale `false` line user ke
# box ko 13-seat board pe pin kar deti thi.
# ROLLBACK (legacy 13-seat A/B): AI_ACCURACY_SUITE=false + per-flag
# values tab wapas respected honge.
AI_ACCURACY_SUITE=true

# Enables the 3 new ensemble seats: SentimentPulse (news/F&G/funding),
# InstFlow (FII/DII + orderbook depth) and FundaCheck (P/E vs sector,
# swing path only). OFF = the exact 11-model ensemble that ships today;
# true = 14 models for the live-validation window. Data sources are all
# free + keyless (Moneycontrol/ET RSS, alternative.me F&G, Binance fapi
# funding, NSE FII/DII, Yahoo quoteSummary) — every feed degrades to an
# honest abstain when unreachable, so the flag is safe to flip on Render.
# Observe via /api/ai/status (v2Models block) + /api/ai/trust (Brier).
# v21.12 (LEGACY): ye value ab sirf AI_ACCURACY_SUITE=false ke saath
# respected hoti hai — master ON ho to suite hamesha ON.
AI_ENABLE_V2_MODELS=true

# ---- v11.6 MESH-BACKED ENSEMBLE SEATS (Superintelligence MCP upgrade) ----
# The 10-agent MCP Data Agent Mesh (Quiver/TradingCentral/AlphaVantage/
# Massive/CoinGecko/CoinAPI/…) finally VOTES on trade decisions via 4 new
# committee seats: InstFlowPro (congressional/insider flow, global desk),
# TechConsensus (independent vendor read), FundaProPlus (deep fundamentals,
# India swing/deep + global), CryptoOnChainPro (on-chain/dev context).
# Seats ship SHADOW-MODE (weight 0, votes journaled) until 10+ settled
# outcomes prove an edge; they abstain on stale mesh data (honesty gate)
# and are correlation-discounted if they just restate TrendMatrix/
# MomentumQuant. Warm is T3-only (top slice, budget-aware cadence) so
# free-tier token buckets survive the day. Requires mesh agent keys to
# actually vote (QUIVER_API_KEY, TRADINGCENTRAL_API_KEY, ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY,
# MASSIVE_API_KEY, COINGECKO_API_KEY, COINAPI_API_KEY — missing key =
# that seat honestly abstains, never fakes).
# Observe via /api/ai/status (meshModels block) + /api/ai/trust
# (meshModels accountability) + the MCP Data Mesh panel (agent health
# + budgets) + the weekly review's Mesh Seats section.
# v21.12 (LEGACY): ye value ab sirf AI_ACCURACY_SUITE=false ke saath
# respected hoti hai (shadow seats — weight 0, consensus par zero
# effect jab tak accountability promote na kare).
AI_ENABLE_MESH_MODELS=true
# T3 warm slice size + per-tick mesh query batch (budget pacing):
AI_MESH_T3_TOP_N=12
AI_MESH_T3_BATCH=8

# ---- v11.8 FULL-COMMITTEE CHECKLIST (why "only 3-4 of 14 models respond") ----
# Live-render diagnosis (2026-09-18) found the committee was losing
# voters to FIVE fixable causes. The CODE fixes are in v11.8 (structural
# abstains leave the quorum denominator; the India board tape seat falls
# back to its 15m read when the 5m base is dead; real NSE/BSE option
# chains feed OptionsFlow on NIFTY/BANKNIFTY; CoinDCX-unreachable depth
# falls back to the Binance USDT book, honestly labeled). The ENV side —
# set these on Render to get the remaining seats LIVE:
#
#   1. AI COUNCIL (w=1.5 — the single heaviest seat; offline = no vote):
#      set at least ONE of GEMINI_API_KEY (recommended, Google AI Studio
#      free tier) / GROQ_API_KEY / CEREBRAS_API_KEY / OPENROUTER_API_KEY.
#      Also brings NeuralChat, the global council and the weekly review
#      LLM layers online.
#   2. MESH AGENT KEYS (6 agents were unauthed on Render — the seats
#      can never even shadow-vote without them). Free-key availability,
#      live-verified 2026-09-18:
#      · ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY — FREE: alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
#        (instant email key; 25 req/day, 5/min — our agent budget 20/day)
#      · COINAPI_API_KEY — FREE: coinapi.io → "Get Free API Key"
#        (100 req/day — our agent budget 60/day)
#      · COINGECKO_API_KEY — FREE Demo: coingecko.com/en/api
#        (10,000 calls/mo, 30/min — stops the keyless 429 breaker trips)
#      · MASSIVE_API_KEY — FREE Basic: massive.com (formerly polygon.io)
#        ($0/mo, 5 req/min, EOD/reference data). v11.8.1: the agent now
#        targets api.polygon.io (the plan's api.massive.dev does NOT
#        resolve); MASSIVE_API_BASE below overrides if domains move.
#      · QUIVER_API_KEY — free tier: api.quiverquant.com (account →
#        API key; limited free requests — fits our 50/day agent budget;
#        full history is paid $25/mo)
#      · TRADINGCENTRAL_API_KEY — NO free/self-serve key exists
#        (enterprise B2B vendor). Leave unset: TechConsensus stays
#        honestly ABSENT by design — never faked.
#      FINNHUB_API_KEY already appears configured.
#   3. Flags (already correct on Render, listed for completeness):
#      AI_ENABLE_V2_MODELS=true · AI_ENABLE_MESH_MODELS=true ·
#      AI_ENABLE_MTF_CONFLUENCE=true · AI_ENABLE_GLOBAL_COUNCIL=true
#   4. Leave AI_ENABLE_REGIME_WEIGHTS OFF until the A/B backtest
#      (`--strategy regime_weighted`) says otherwise.
# Mesh seats stay SHADOW (weight 0) until 10+ settled outcomes prove an
# edge — that is the honest design, not a missing configuration.
# Massive/Polygon REST base (v11.8.1 — default api.polygon.io, live-
# verified; the original api.massive.dev domain does not resolve):
MASSIVE_API_BASE=https://api.polygon.io

# ---- MTF CONFLUENCE (Upgrade 1 — Phase 1 ON) ----
# 5m/15m/1h time-frame confluence engine on the India intraday desk
# (IntradayTapeMTF, weight 1.6, replaces the plain 15m tape w1.3 when
# ON). Falls back to the plain 15m tape when the 5m base is dead.
# v21.12 (LEGACY): ye value ab sirf AI_ACCURACY_SUITE=false ke saath
# respected hoti hai — master ON ho to crypto/futures desks graceful
# 15m-degrade ke saath w1.6 MTF seat use karte hain.
AI_ENABLE_MTF_CONFLUENCE=true

# ---- v21.23.17 MTF VOTE V2 + DIRECTION-EDGE GATES ----
# MTF vote v2 (server/ai/mtf.js) is the shipped default:
#   • ATR-normalized 3-bar momentum + 2-bar context hysteresis.
#   • Structure-aware reversal guard (swing break + context + ATR move).
#   • Direction threshold 1.4; counter-structure strength capped at 60.
#   • A counter-structure vote is NEUTRAL unless a confirmed pump/dump has
#     closed beyond EMA50 in the vote direction — a shallow bounce inside a
#     clean trend can no longer flip the 15m vote to +1.
# MTF_VOTE_V2=1 is the default. Set to 0/false/off/no/disabled/legacy for the
# EXACT legacy vote (threshold 0.9, absolute-% momentum, no v2 telemetry).
# MTF_VOTE_V2=1

# Intraday direction-edge gates (server/intraday/engine.js):
#   off     → legacy behaviour (telemetry only)
#   shadow  → telemetry only, confidence unchanged (DEFAULT, rollout-safe)
#   enforce → sub-minimum margin / stale quote capped at INTRADAY_NO_EDGE_CAP
#             (69), below the routes entry floor (70), so it cannot trade.
# Rollout: leave both gates on shadow until GET /api/ai/direction-report has
# enough settled rows. Its `gateReadiness` block compares the cohort each gate
# would block vs the cohort it keeps (min 10 blocked + 20 kept resolved rows,
# blocked win-rate ≤50%, ≥8pp underperformance gap) and prints the exact
# promotion next-step. Only then set enforce on Render.
# INTRADAY_MARGIN_GATE=shadow
# INTRADAY_MIN_MARGIN=12
# INTRADAY_STALE_GUARD=shadow
# INTRADAY_STALE_MAX_PCT=1.2
# Blank values fall back to the documented defaults (never 0/silently off).

# ---- META-ENSEMBLE (Upgrade 4 — Phase 5: trained + activated) ----
# Routes the model votes through the trained LightGBM meta-learner on
# the ml-service (FastAPI). SAFE by design: the Node ensemble falls back
# to the in-process weighted average whenever ML_SERVICE_URL is
# unreachable or the meta artifacts are missing (honest degrade + 5-min
# circuit breaker, never a hard failure).
# v21.12 DEFAULT ON (user ask — ml-service deploy ke baad): ml-service
# ab 127.0.0.1:8100 pe hai (v21.11 port fix — 8000 pehle
# Laya local AI ka port tha, v21.14 me Laya remove ho gaya).
# ml-service chalane ke liye: cd ml-service && pip install -r
# requirements.txt && uvicorn app.main:app --port 8100 (ya ML_PORT=8100).
# The baseline artifacts (meta_ensemble.pkl + meta_feature_cols.pkl,
# 6,630 samples · 29 vote-features) ship IN THE REPO; the ml-service
# retrains them weekly (META_RETRAIN_INTERVAL_HOURS, default 168) via
# the in-process background worker armed at FastAPI startup.
AI_ENABLE_META_ENSEMBLE=true
# Where the ml-service lives (v21.12: default uncommented — 8100):
ML_SERVICE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8100
# Weekly retrain cadence (hours) + boot behavior knobs:
# META_RETRAIN_INTERVAL_HOURS=168
# META_RETRAIN_DAEMON=true
# META_RETRAIN_ON_BOOT=true
# META_RETRAIN_FETCH=true

# ---- v10.6 PRO ACCURACY UPGRADES ----
# Cross-exchange price validation (Pro #3): CoinDCX ticks are checked
# against Binance (spot /api/v3 + futures /fapi/v1 — free, keyless,
# validator-only). A fresh >0.5% (majors) / >1.5% (alts) cross-venue gap
# suppresses the signal vote / SL-TP trigger for that tick; a reverted
# wick lands in the journal as WICK_SUPPRESSED. ON by default — set to
# 1 to disable.
AI_DISABLE_WICK_FILTER=false
# Per-base deviation thresholds (%) — majors default 0.5, alts 1.5.
AI_WICK_THRESHOLD_PCT=
AI_WICK_ALT_THRESHOLD_PCT=
# Regime-aware model reweighting (Pro #4): TRENDING/CHOPPY/HIGH_VOL/
# LOW_VOL tilts the 14 model weights ±25% max (weighted-average path
# only). Default OFF — A/B it first: backtest panel strategy=
# regime_weighted, or `python -m models.backtest --strategy
# regime_weighted` in ml-service.
AI_ENABLE_REGIME_WEIGHTS=false
# Edge-adaptive Kelly-lite sizing (Pro #2): riskPerTradePct becomes the
# CEILING; the confidence bucket's realized win-rate (trust calibration,
# ≥10 settled) sizes at HALF-Kelly. Negative edge → entry skipped with
# the reason logged. Default OFF.
AI_ENABLE_KELLY_SIZING=false
# Slippage-aware execution (Pro #6): expected slippage from the L2 depth
# walk above this % (or notional beyond the visible book) → TWAP-lite
# split into 2-4 child orders with 2s gaps. Default 0.35%.
AI_SLIPPAGE_THRESHOLD_PCT=
# AI Council debate mode (v10.8 Pro #1): bull advocate → bear advocate →
# PM verdict — 3 grounded LLM steps instead of one single-shot call.
# Default ON; any step failing degrades to the legacy single-shot path.
AI_COUNCIL_DEBATE=

# ============================================================
# v21.0 LOCAL OLLAMA SUPERINTELLIGENCE (16GB laptop optimized)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Aapke paas already: deepseek-r1:14b (deep reasoner) + qwen3:8b
# (fast scanner). Ye config unhe ASLI council seats bana deta hai —
# BINA kisi cloud key ke AI Council / validator / weekly review sab
# local chalte hain.
#
# KAUNSA MODEL KAUNSE KAAM KE LIYE (research-verified):
#   qwen3:8b        -> scan/council seat (fast, best Hindi/English,
#                      thinking mode, ~6.5GB RAM)
#   deepseek-r1:14b -> deep single-symbol analysis (best financial
#                      CoT reasoning, ~10-11GB RAM)
#   qwen2.5vl:7b    -> VISION seat (chart screenshot analysis —
#                      "Vision AI" button chart par; ~7.5GB RAM)
#                      Install: ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b
#
# IMPORTANT (Ollama server ke liye — Windows me System env ya
# ollama serve se pehle set karo):
#   OLLAMA_MAX_LOADED_MODELS=1   (16GB me 14B+8B dono resident = OOM)
#   OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL=1        (ek request at a time, KV memory bachao)
#   OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=5m         (idle unload — Node/browser ko RAM)
#   OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0    (~50% KV memory kam, quality same)
# ============================================================
# Chain: sirf local Ollama use karo (cloud skip, zero API cost):
LLM_LOCAL_ONLY=1
# Ya mixed-mode (pehle local, cloud fallback):
# LLM_PRIORITY=ollama,gemini,groq,cerebras,openrouter,huggingface,nvidia
# Scan seat (fast) — default auto-pick installed models se:
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:8b
# Deep seat (reasoning) — single-symbol deep analysis ke liye:
OLLAMA_DEEP_MODEL=deepseek-r1:14b
# Vision seat (chart screenshots) — install: ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b
# OLLAMA_VISION_MODEL=qwen2.5vl:7b
# Ollama base URL (default localhost):
# OLLAMA_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# Context budget (tokens) — 16GB system pe auto-clamp 8192 hota hai
# (RAM guard); 32GB+ ho ya browser band ho to badha sakte ho:
# OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=8192
# OLLAMA_NUM_CTX_DEEP=8192
# Idle keep-alive (Ollama service-level default override yahan se):
# OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=5m

# ---- INTERACTIVE TELEGRAM BOT (v10.1) ----
# v21.0 TELEGRAM NOTIFICATIONS TROUBLESHOOTING (koi alerts nahi aa rahe?):
#   1. TG_TOKEN + TG_CHAT_ID DONO set hone chahiye (aadha pair = dono OFF).
#   2. Bot ko apne chat me ek baar /start bhejo (403 "chat not found" ka
#      ek hi ilaaj hai — boot self-test exact reason log karta hai).
#   3. Watchdog ab telegram-bot/node_modules KHUD install karta hai
#      (pehle bot crash-loop karta tha — #1 silent outage tha).
#   4. localhost pe TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET KHAALI rakho (set hai to
#      polling bot fork nahi hota — webhook ke bina sab dead).
#   5. Delivery health: /api/ai/insta-push/status me "delivery" block
#      (24h sent/failed counters + lastError).
# Makes the bot LISTEN (the /crypto, /intraday, /status commands).
# Setup (one-time after deploy):
#   1. Generate a random secret: `openssl rand -hex 24`
#   2. Set it as TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET below (server env — Render)
#   3. Login to the site → POST /api/telegram/setup-webhook
#      { "url": "https://your-render-app.onrender.com" }
# Security: every incoming Telegram request must carry this secret in
# the X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token header (Telegram adds it
# automatically from setWebhook) AND come from an allowlisted chat id.
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ---- v10.9 #6: MULTI-USER ROLES ----
# Comma-separated "chatid:role" pairs. The configured chat id (secrets
# store / TG_CHAT_ID) is ALWAYS admin. Chats listed here get access:
#   admin  — desk agents + /trade approvals (when the flow is armed)
#   viewer — read-only: desk agents, /status, /weeklyreview, voice notes
# Everyone else stays silently ignored. Example:
#   TELEGRAM_ROLES="987654321:viewer,111222333:viewer"
TELEGRAM_ROLES=

# ---- v10.9 #4: CONTROLLED TELEGRAM ORDER APPROVAL (opt-in!) ----
# Everything defaults OFF. To arm:
#   AI_TELEGRAM_APPROVALS=on
#   AI_APPROVAL_PIN=your 4-12 digit PIN   (mandatory — no PIN, no approvals)
# Flow: /trade BTC LONG 5000 x3 paper → Approve button → PIN → the
# site's EXACT executeSignal gauntlet (fresh-signal re-verification,
# kill switch, risk caps, mandate freeze). The button is a manual
# trigger — it bypasses NOTHING.
AI_TELEGRAM_APPROVALS=
AI_APPROVAL_PIN=
AI_APPROVAL_MAX_PER_DAY=3
AI_APPROVAL_TTL_MS=300000

# ---- v10.9 #2: INSTANT TELEGRAM PUSH ----
# The price-driven sink: SL/TP/LIQ level touches pushed within seconds
# (5s poll while positions are open) + fresh STRONG signals every ~30s
# (correlated clusters bundled into ONE message, r >= 0.75). The 60s
# watcher stays the executor; the legacy bot's 10-min cron becomes a
# backup heartbeat. Set off to revert to watcher-only alerts.
AI_INSTANT_PUSH=

# ---- v10.9 #3: WEEKLY TRADE-PERFORMANCE DIGEST ----
# Sunday 19:00 IST auto-push of the journal + calibration review
# (quant-computed numbers + one LLM narration). /weeklyreview runs it
# on demand regardless of this flag. Set off to disable the auto-push.
AI_WEEKLY_REVIEW_PUSH=

# SECURITY — REQUIRED (no defaults)
APP_PIN=change_me_to_a_strong_pin
VITE_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace_with_strong_32_char_secret

# Cloud-sync auth token (Apps Script + backend proxy). Server-side name is
# API_TOKEN (used by /api/cloud/*). VITE_API_TOKEN is the browser-bundle copy
# and is ONLY needed if you use DIRECT cloud sync instead of the proxy —
# remember anything VITE_-prefixed is readable by anyone who opens the bundle.
API_TOKEN=replace_with_strong_24plus_char_secret
# VITE_API_TOKEN=replace_with_strong_24plus_char_secret

# CORS allowlist (comma-separated, for cross-origin Vercel→Render).
# SECURITY: in production (NODE_ENV=production) CORS is FAIL-CLOSED when this
# is unset — no cross-origin requests will be authorized.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-app.vercel.app

# AI PROVIDER KEYS (server-side only)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here
CLAUDE_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key_here
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your_cerebras_key_here
HF_API_KEY=your_huggingface_key_here
NVIDIA_API_KEY=your_nvidia_key_here
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly_your_key_here

# Telegram Bot (server-side only)
TG_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
TG_CHAT_ID=your_chat_id_here
# Shared secret for the bot's /api/* LLM relay when the bot runs standalone
# (npm run start:telegram). When set, relay calls require this Bearer token.
BOT_API_SECRET=replace_with_strong_24plus_char_secret

# Google Apps Script (Cloud Portfolio Sync) — server-side name
API_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec

# If frontend is on a DIFFERENT origin (Vercel), set this:
# VITE_API_PROXY=https://your-backend.onrender.com

# Real-time market data
# FINNHUB_API_KEY is SHARED (v10.11): the US desk (/api/quote + the WS
# stream) AND the EQUITY SIM USDC desk's fallback chain both use it via
# server/ai/finnhubQuote.js — one micro-cache + one 55/min sliding-window
# rate limiter, so neither desk can starve the other's free-tier budget.
# ULTRAFAST USA (v21.6): a FREE finnhub.com key unlocks the US trade
# WebSocket (instant push for covered symbols). Without it the US desk
# still runs ultrafast on the TradingView batch (~3s) + Yahoo fallback.
FINNHUB_API_KEY=your_finnhub_key_here

# ── ULTRAFAST INDIA (v21.6) — OFFICIAL Groww Trading-API tier ──────────────
# Groww has NO websocket (verified 2026-10-12 — the official Trading API is
# REST-only: groww.in/trade-api/docs). The FASTEST direct-Groww path is the
# official /v1/live-data/ltp endpoint: ONE batched call serves up to 50
# symbols at 1-second freshness (limits: 10 req/s, 300/min).
# With BOTH keys below set, India ticks upgrade:
#   public CDN tier 1.5s  →  official API tier 1s   (badge: Groww·API)
# WITHOUT keys the public tier alone still runs at 1.5s (badge: Groww·live).
# Get keys: Groww app/web → Profile → Settings → Trading APIs → Generate
# (needs an active Trading API subscription; the access token auto-refreshes
# daily at ~05:00 IST via the checksum flow — no manual steps).
# GROWW_API_KEY=your_groww_trading_api_key
# GROWW_API_SECRET=your_groww_trading_api_secret
# GROWW_API=1            # optional force-on (default: on when both keys exist)
# GROWW_API=0            # force-off (public 1.5s tier carries India)

# ML service (optional) — required when exposing ml-service beyond localhost
# ML_API_TOKEN=replace_with_strong_24plus_char_secret
# ML_CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-app.vercel.app

# Broker connectors (optional)
DHAN_CLIENT_ID=your_dhan_client_id
DHAN_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_dhan_access_token
SHOONYA_USER_ID=your_shoonya_user_id
SHOONYA_PASSWORD=your_shoonya_password
SHOONYA_VENDOR_CODE=your_vendor_code
SHOONYA_API_KEY=your_api_key
SHOONYA_IMEI=100001

# ---- Durable runtime state (Render free plan) ----
# Render's free tier wipes server/data/ on every restart, which used to reset
# the paper-trading history to 0 AND destroy the INDMoney OAuth tokens +
# CoinDCX API keys (forcing a full re-connect after every deploy). Set these
# to mirror that state to a branch of this GitHub repo (auto-restored on
# boot). MCP credential files are pushed AES-256-GCM ENCRYPTED, so the backup
# branch never leaks keys even in a public repo:
#   GITHUB_BACKUP_TOKEN  — fine-grained PAT, Contents: Read and Write
#   GITHUB_BACKUP_REPO   — "owner/repo-name" (private repo recommended)
#   GITHUB_BACKUP_BRANCH — MUST differ from the deploy branch (default: data-backup)
#   DURABLE_KEY          — OPTIONAL dedicated encryption key (>=16 chars).
#                          If unset, the key is auto-derived from
#                          APP_PIN + API_TOKEN (already in your Render env —
#                          zero extra setup). NOTE: rotating APP_PIN or
#                          API_TOKEN makes old backups undecryptable.
GITHUB_BACKUP_TOKEN=
GITHUB_BACKUP_REPO=
GITHUB_BACKUP_BRANCH=data-backup
DURABLE_KEY=

# ---- INDMoney + CoinDCX asset-table sync ----
# Auto-sync slots (IST, comma-separated HH:MM). Default: 09:30 & 21:30.
# The scheduler catches up missed slots up to 4h late (Render free-tier
# sleep). CoinDCX crypto rows ride the same schedule; the crypto price
# feed itself is always live (SSE).
INDM_SYNC_TIMES=09:30,21:30

# ---- v10.17 FULL UNIVERSE SCAN (India desk) ----
# ON by default. Tiered cadence: T1 (base watchlist + hot names) scanned
# every cycle, T2 (the ~220 most-traded NSE names discovered via the TV
# turnover filter) scanned in rotating quarter-slices — whole-market
# coverage every ~4 board cycles. Hot T2 names (|chg|>=2.5% / relVol>=2 /
# RSI 72+/28-) ride T1 cadence for 20 min. "off" reverts to the static
# ~45-name F&O base (byte-identical legacy behavior).
# AI_INDIA_FULL_UNIVERSE=off
# Discovery depth (60-500 NSE names by turnover). Default 220.
# AI_INDIA_FULL_UNIVERSE_SIZE=220

# ---- v10.17 OPTIONS SCANNER ----
# Number of stock-option underlyings (top NSE turnover F&O names) scanned
# alongside NIFTY/SENSEX/BANKNIFTY on GET /api/ai/options-scan (0-10).
# AI_OPTIONS_SCAN_STOCKS=6

# ==================== v11.1 INDIA DESK DEEP-GAPS ====================
# ---- GAP 2: CIRCUIT-LIMIT GUARD (NSE daily price bands) ----
# Groww's live quote carries the day's band (highPriceRange/lowPriceRange)
# on the SAME fetch the desk already makes. A same-direction entry near
# the adverse band (LONG->upper / SHORT->lower circuit) takes a heavy
# confidence penalty + a distinct reason flag + target clamps; open
# positions drifting toward an ADVERSE circuit fire urgent CIRCUIT_RISK
# alerts (paper watcher + India agent sweep). Bands unknown -> guard inert.
# Proximity threshold in % distance from the band (default 1.5).
# AI_CIRCUIT_PROXIMITY_PCT=1.5
# Confidence penalty for same-direction entries near the band (default 18).
# AI_CIRCUIT_PENALTY=18

# ---- GAP 3: REAL TRANSACTION COSTS on the paper desk ----
# Every closed paper trade stores grossPnl + costs + netPnl (net is the
# displayed headline; gross rides in tooltips). Rates = current published
# India schedules (Oct-2024 levels) — pin YOUR broker's numbers:
# Brokerage: 'flat' = Rs per executed ORDER (default 20, Zerodha-style;
# a T1+T2 two-part close = 3 orders) | 'percent' = % of turnover.
# AI_TC_BROKERAGE_MODE=flat
# AI_TC_BROKERAGE_FLAT=20
# AI_TC_BROKERAGE_PCT=0.03
# Statutory overrides (defaults in parentheses):
#   equity-intraday: STT 0.025% sell (0.025) · NSE txn 0.00297% both
#     (0.00297) · SEBI 0.0001% both (0.0001) · stamp 0.003% buy (0.003)
#   equity-futures:  STT 0.02% sell (0.02) · txn 0.00173% (0.00173)
#     · SEBI (0.0001) · stamp 0.002% buy (0.002)
#   options:         STT 0.1% sell premium (0.10) · txn 0.03503% premium
#     (0.03503) · SEBI (0.0001) · stamp 0.003% buy premium (0.003)
#   GST 18% on (brokerage + txn + SEBI) is fixed by law — not tunable.
# Per-instrument override keys (suffix = instrument, underscores):
# AI_TC_STT_EQUITY_INTRADAY=0.025
# AI_TC_TXN_EQUITY_INTRADAY=0.00297
# AI_TC_STT_OPTIONS=0.10
# AI_TC_TXN_OPTIONS=0.03503
# AI_TC_STT_EQUITY_FUTURES=0.02
# Crypto paper trades: approximate taker fee % per side (no STT/GST).
# AI_TC_CRYPTO_FEE_PCT=0.05

# ---- NSE + SENSEX addendum: SENSEX source honesty ----
# BSE blocks datacenter IPs structurally (spike-verified: bseindia.com +
# api.bseindia.com both 403 Akamai). SENSEX premiums are therefore ALWAYS
# Black-Scholes model estimates here (tagged 'bs-model-sensex-always',
# persistent banner, NIFTY-family keeps the recoverable
# 'bs-model-nifty-fallback' framing). Structural AI-score discount on
# SENSEX model cards — no live-market cross-check is possible (default 8).
# AI_SENSEX_MODEL_DISCOUNT=8

# ---- GAP 1: SECTOR MAP x FULL UNIVERSE ----
# Rides the same AI_INDIA_FULL_UNIVERSE switch above: the sector desk
# buckets the FULL discovered universe (curated static table first, TV's
# own sector taxonomy next, honest OTHERS for the rest) — an out-of-45
# F&O name finally surfaces through the sector lens. Flag off = the
# legacy static 45-name map, byte-identical.

# ==================== v11.0 SUPERINTELLIGENCE — GLOBAL MARKET COUNCIL ====================
# The 5-layer superintelligence pipeline: MCP Data Agent Mesh (10 agents)
# → quant feature engine → 6 specialist LLM seats → calibrated consensus +
# PRECISION GATE → stamped verdicts on both desks' signal boards.
# Everything below is OPTIONAL; the master switch defaults OFF (A/B-able
# against the v10.18 baseline — flag off = byte-identical boards).

# ---- MASTER SWITCH (default off) ----
# ON = top-5 board candidates go to the 6-seat council each cycle
# (~6 batched LLM calls / 90s, per-symbol verdict cache; suppressed
# verdicts land in the near-miss journal for the weekly review).
# AI_ENABLE_GLOBAL_COUNCIL=on

# ---- Council tuning ----
# Bull/bear debate rounds in DEEP mode (0-2; default 1). Deep mode =
# ~9 LLM calls per symbol (board mode stays 6 batched).
# AI_COUNCIL_DEBATE_ROUNDS=1
# Precision-gate publish bar: confidence (default 78; strict arm 84 to
# chase 95%+ published precision) and agreement floor (default 0.70).
# AI_PRECISION_GATE_CONF=78
# AI_PRECISION_GATE_AGREEMENT=0.70
# Auto-tighten on a 3-week precision breach streak (<75% each week):
# conf bar +5 per breach, cumulative cap +10, auto-reset at >=85%.
# off disables the mechanism (reporting continues in the weekly review).
# AI_PRECISION_GATE_AUTO_TIGHTEN=on

# ---- MCP mesh tuning ----
# Per-agent deadline in ms (default 8000) + hot-cache window in seconds
# (default 30; warm 5min / cold 60min are fixed tiers).
# AI_MCP_MESH_TIMEOUT_MS=8000
# AI_MCP_MESH_CACHE_HOT_SEC=30

# ---- MCP data agents (missing key = agent honestly ABSENT, never faked) ----
# Alpha Vantage — world stocks/forex/crypto quotes + fundamentals.
# Free tier 25/day; our budget 20/day.
# ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=
# CoinGecko (official MCP vendor; demo key) — crypto prices, trending,
# market caps, on-chain context. Public endpoints also work keyless.
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=
# TradingCentral — real-time news sentiment + buzzing (paid; absent without key).
# TRADINGCENTRAL_API_KEY=
# Quiver Quantitative — US alt-data (Congress trades, insider activity).
# QUIVER_API_KEY=
# Massive — fundamentals + independent BS-Greeks/Sharpe quant checks.
# MASSIVE_API_KEY=
# CoinAPI — tick-level crypto trades (fallback role; 100/day free).
# COINAPI_API_KEY=
# Alpaca — US quotes (IEX feed) + market news (free paper-tier key pair).
# ALPACA_API_KEY=
# ALPACA_API_SECRET=
# (CCXT-style exchange mesh + TradingView + Finnhub ride the repo's own
#  proven keyless/fexisting feeds — zero extra keys.)

# ============================================================
# v11.3 — CoinDCX OFFICIAL WebSocket price layer (24x7 realtime)
# The spot socket (stream-spot.coindcx.com, currentPrices@spot@1s +
# priceStats@spot@60s) and the futures book channel
# (stream.coindcx.com, currentPrices@futures@rt) back the whole price
# chain when Cloudflare-fronted REST (api/public.coindcx.com) times
# out from datacenter IPs. '0' disables the spot socket entirely.
# AI_CX_SPOT_WS=1

# ============================================================
# v12.0 — PRO TRADER UPGRADE (win-probability + perp positioning)
# Both engines run on FREE PUBLIC data (Binance fapi reference +
# the repo's own signal ledger) — ZERO new keys required.
# AI_DISABLE_PERP_INTEL=0

# ============================================================
# v13.2 — FULL IMPLEMENTATION PLAN (accuracy track A + bandwidth B)
# ============================================================
# B6 BANDWIDTH TELEMETRY — rolling-24h wire accounting + 30-day
# projection vs the Render cap, hourly Telegram alert past the
# threshold. View: GET /api/ai/bandwidth.
# BANDWIDTH_MONTHLY_CAP_GB=5
# BANDWIDTH_ALERT_PCT=70
# A2 LLM SECOND-OPINION VALIDATOR — when ensemble confidence is
# borderline (default 45-60), the provider chain (Gemini -> Groq ->
# Cerebras -> OpenRouter) gets ONE strict-JSON second opinion per
# symbol per 15m candle; rides s.verify.llm on cards + agent chat.
# AI_ENABLE_LLM_VALIDATOR=true

# v18.9 FEE HONESTY: taker fee % per side deducted from every booked crypto
# close/leg (default 0.10 = 0.10%/side, honest net P&L + daily-loss cap).
# Set 0 to disable (gross P&L, pre-v18.9 behavior).
# AI_COINDCX_FEE_PCT=0.10
# AI_LLM_VALIDATOR_BAND=45,60
# A5 MCP TOOL GOVERNANCE — every desk-agent tool call rate-limited
# (per-desk rolling minute cap) + audit-logged (placeOrder-class
# flagged). View: GET /api/ai/mcp-audit.
# AI_MCP_RATE_PER_MIN=60

# v18.10 COINDCX EXCHANGE ACCOUNT (auto-connect at boot):
# Put your CoinDCX API key + secret here and the server connects the
# account AT BOOT (validated with a real /users/balances call, then
# persisted server-side in server/data/mcp-coindcx.json — same as the
# Portfolio tab -> Connect CoinDCX flow). Wallet card flips to
# "LIVE - API CONNECTED", LIVE order mode unblocks, agent reads real
# equity. Optional aliases: COINDCX_KEY/COINDCX_APIKEY/COINDCX_PUBLIC_KEY
# for the key, COINDCX_API_SECRET/COINDCX_SECRET_KEY/COINDCX_PRIVATE_KEY
# for the secret. Create the key in the CoinDCX app with view/balance
# (+ trade for orders) permission. Invalid pair = one warning line,
# app continues in paper mode (never a brick).
# COINDCX_API_KEY=your_coindcx_api_key
# COINDCX_SECRET=your_coindcx_secret

# v19.0 SELF-IMPROVEMENT ENGINE (Phases 1-5) — the closed learning loop:
# harvest settled outcomes -> drift watch (PSI/calibration/perf) ->
# ml-service retrain bridge + champion/challenger shadow -> gate tuner
# (proposal-only) -> lessons engine (versioned, injected into Council
# debates) -> strategy evolution (bounded genetic search) -> selfCouncil
# governance (tiered approvals + rollback). Full view:
# GET /api/ai/self/status. Auto-trading scope note: CoinDCX auto-agent
# desks = FUTURES (USDT margin) + GLOBAL EQUITY SIM (USDC) only — SPOT
# auto-entry is OFF by default (manual spot trading unaffected).
# Kill-switch (default ON — false = monitoring only, nothing applies):
# SELFIMPROVE_ENABLED=true
# Safe-tier gate proposals auto-apply after 24h ONLY when true (risky
# tier is ALWAYS human-approved; default false = all proposals manual):
# SELFIMPROVE_AUTO_TUNE=false
# Drift ALARM may auto-fire an ml-service retrain ONLY when true
# (default false = retrain is manual/API-triggered only):
# SELFIMPROVE_AUTO_RETRAIN=false

# ---- v19.1 NEVER-DOWN STABILITY GUARD ----
# Crash policy: uncaught exception me app STAY-ALIVE rehti hai (recommended
# for localhost/Windows). true = purana v18.1 exit-for-restart (supervised
# deployments jaise Render ke liye):
# SELFHEAL_EXIT_ON_FATAL=false
# Memory watchdog limits (MB) — breach pe cache-trims + loud log:
# SELFHEAL_RSS_LIMIT_MB=1400
# SELFHEAL_HEAP_LIMIT_MB=1100
# Poora self-heal guard off (not recommended):
# SELFHEAL_ENABLED=true

# ---- v21.3.0 SIGNAL ACCURACY + BOARD AI CONFIRM (Issues 3/5/7) ----
# Hard HTF veto: 1d/4h directly against the signal side -> grade WATCH +
# aiScore cap 62 (0 = off, haircuts-only legacy behaviour):
# AI_VETO_COUNTER_HTF=1
# Chop filter: 6-TF SPLIT phase ya ADX<15 -> grade cap WATCH (0 = off):
# AI_VETO_CHOP=1
# Sub-noise stop floor: swing-structure stop minimum itna ATR-distance rakhta hai:
# AI_MIN_STOP_ATR_FRACTION=0.6
# 15m tape enrichment coverage (board candidates; 20 = v21.2 behaviour):
# AI_TAPE_ENRICH_N=40
# Jev board confirmation layer (off/auto): top board signals provider
# se confirm — AGREE -> +3 score (CONFIRMED chip); provider ULTA side ->
# -8 + STRONG->ACTION (CONFLICT chip, TOP-5 se exclude). (v21.14: Laya
# removed — jev-only.) Provider unconfigured (no key) = layer silent off:
# AI_BOARD_CONFIRM=auto
# AI_BOARD_CONFIRM_N=6
# AI_BOARD_CONFIRM_MIN_SCORE=75

# ---- v21.3.0 RENDER / SMALL-CONTAINER DEPLOYMENT (Issue-1 fix) ----
# NOTE: v21.3.0 se constrained platform (Render dyno, Railway, cgroup
# memory.max < 1.5GB) par ye values AUTO-Detect ho jaati hain — memory
# limits 420/330MB + exit-on-fatal ON. Neeche wale overrides sirf tab
# chahiye jab auto-detection galat ho. MOST IMPORTANT (code se nahi ho
# sakta): Render free tier 15 min idle baad SLEEP karta hai — 24x7 ke
# liye ek FREE external uptime monitor (UptimeRobot / BetterStack) set
# karo jo har 5 min https://<your-app>.onrender.com/api/ping hit kare.
# SELFHEAL_EXIT_ON_FATAL=true
# SELFHEAL_RSS_LIMIT_MB=420
# SELFHEAL_HEAP_LIMIT_MB=330
# WARM_ON_BOOT=0
# SMARTAI_NO_CGROUP_PROBE=0
# Stdout log governor — console pipe freeze/overflow se bachav. off = raw:
# LOG_GOVERNOR=on
# LOG_LINES_PER_MIN=240
# LOG_DEDUPE_MS=20000

# ---- v19.2 ANTI-FREEZE SUPERVISOR ----
# External watchdog (Start-SmartAI-Watchdog.bat -> node server/supervisor.js):
# har 20s /api/ping probe apne event loop se; 3 consecutive timeout =
# FREEZE verdict -> force-kill + restart (crash/OOM bhi auto-restart).
# WATCHDOG_PORT=8080
# WATCHDOG_PROBE_MS=20000
# WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS=9000
# WATCHDOG_FAILS=3
# WATCHDOG_GRACE_MS=45000
# WATCHDOG_BACKOFF_BASE_MS=3000
# WATCHDOG_BACKOFF_MAX_MS=60000
# WATCHDOG_MAX_RESTARTS_HOUR=20
# WATCHDOG_BUDGET_PAUSE_MS=600000
# File log (5MB x 2 rotation) — off = console only:
# WATCHDOG_LOG_FILE=server/data/logs/server.log
# WATCHDOG_DISABLE=1 (probes off = restart-on-exit only mode)
# Windows QuickEdit console-freeze programmatic guard (win32 best-effort):
# QUICKEDIT_GUARD=on

# ---- v20.0.1 DEPS AUTO-INSTALL (fresh-install self-heal) ----
# Supervisor boot se pehle package.json deps vs app node_modules audit
# karta hai; missing ho to npm install KHud chalata hai (internet chahiye,
# output [npm] lines me dikhta hai). Crash pe ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND sniff
# hota hai -> honest "DEPENDENCY MISSING" message + auto-install retry.
# Off karne ke liye (manual npm install prefer karo to):
# WATCHDOG_AUTO_INSTALL=0
# npm install max wait (ms; default 15 min):
# WATCHDOG_INSTALL_TIMEOUT_MS=900000
# App-root override (rare — non-standard installs only):
# WATCHDOG_APP_ROOT=D:\SmartAI26\app

# ---- v20.7 EXECUTION STACK (position manager + reconciler) ----
# EXEC_MODE: paper (default, simulated fills) | live
EXEC_MODE=paper
# Leader lease — only ONE node may place orders. SMARTAI_EXEC_LEADER names the
# node allowed to trade (default "laptop"); SMARTAI_EXEC_NODE names THIS node.
# Leave SMARTAI_EXEC_NODE unset on a single-node setup. On a secondary copy
# (e.g. Render) set SMARTAI_EXEC_NODE=render so it never enters new trades.
# SMARTAI_EXEC_LEADER=laptop
# SMARTAI_EXEC_NODE=laptop

# ---- AI PROVIDER (Bot Lab — Jev cloud) ----
# v21.14.0: LAYA LOCAL AI MODEL PERMANENTLY REMOVED. Purane LAYA_* env
# vars ab code me padhe hi nahi jate — .env me pade rehne par bhi koi
# asar nahi (safe to delete). Jev (TypeSafe cloud) hi ek matra AI
# provider hai. Bot Lab arms: Rules / Gated / Jev / Auto (jev).
# AI sirf ENTRY approve/veto karta hai — side flip / sizing / SL/TP
# KABHI nahi. Hard risk (botRisk, kill switch, event guard) sab se upar.
#
# --- common AI mode ---
# Default arm agar bot ke state me arm set nahi (UI se per-bot badla jaata hai):
BOTS_ARM=gated
# AI mode config (v21.14: primary hamesha jev hai):
AI_SHADOW=off
AI_CONSENSUS_ON_DOWN=wait
#
# --- Jev (TypeSafe cloud) — purane JEV_* names unchanged ---
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# Base URL (full-endpoint JEV_URL=... bhi chalega):
JEV_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai
JEV_MODEL=jev-latest
JEV_THRESHOLD=0.30
JEV_TIMEOUT_MS=4000
# JEV_RETRIES=3
# JEV_FALLBACK=wait   # 'rule' kabhi consciously hi chuno
# JEV_CONCURRENCY=0   # 0 = unlimited (FIFO gate off)
# JEV_RETRY_ON_TIMEOUT=1
#
# Board AI-confirm SWRV: memo expire hone par bhi purana verdict turant
# stamp (0-latency) + background refresh. AI_CONFIRM_SWRV=0 = hamesha fresh.
# AI_CONFIRM_SWRV=1
#
# Troubleshooting:
#  - "Jev arm 409 provider_unavailable" = TYPESAFE_API_KEY check karo
#    (OpsHealthStrip AI chip grey = not configured).
#  - http_422 rejects = payload contract mismatch — rejects counter
#    badhta hai, breaker NAHI tripta (4xx provider-down nahi hai).
#  - Provider down = breaker open -> jev/auto arm wale bots honest WAIT
#    mode me (kabhi AI ke bina trade nahi; rules/gated untouched).

